<h2>Asobi 0.9 (build 769)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Past Reviews is now the Review Manager.</b> It always listed the reviews still running and let you end them, so it is named for that: Session &#9656; Review Manager&#8230; (&#8997;&#8984;R). Live reviews sit at the top under <i>Live now</i>, past ones below, and the Shared Review panel says how many are live first.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
